		(uuid "b6e2886f-74d8-58a9-b640-689eb9dd1609")
	)
	(text "ADL5380 NOTES (DS Rev B)\n- VS 4.75–5.25 V on +5V_DEMOD; per-pin 100 pF C0G + 0.1 µF; budget ~250 mA (measure).\n- ENBL low = enabled (0R to GND). ADJ open for >5 GHz (DNP footprint to VS for IIP3 tuning).\n- RF: single-ended RX -> Johanson 5400BL15B050 balun -> series-resonant C0G DC blocks -> RFIP/RFIN.\n  Keep balun-to-pin traces < ~1.4 mm and symmetric.\n- LO: LO_P/LO_N already AC-coupled on MAX2871 sheet (C620/C621). No second DC block.\n- BB out: 50 Ω diff, CM ≈ VS-1.2 V with ADJ open. DNP diff load per pair. I/Q mapping: IHI(3)->I_P, ILO(4)->I_N,\n  QHI(16)->Q_P, QLO(15)->Q_N. RF: T701 pin 3 -> RX_BAL_P -> RFIP(22), pin 4 -> RX_BAL_N -> RFIN(21).\n  LO: LO_P -> LOIN(10), LO_N -> LOIP(9) (RF and LO polarity picked for crossing-free routing).\n  Swapping the I or the Q pair (not both) flips the Doppler sign;\n  swapping the RF or LO pair inverts I and Q together and does not.\n- EP: thermal vias + windowpane paste (layout).\n- +5V is a placeholder rail; its source (Regulators sheet) is TBD. Pin 12 NC: do not connect."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 96.52 184.15 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ab669237-b681-5aaa-8f90-599fa0e2672a")
	)
